        "description": "Suixinlog is a personal space to capture life, organize actions and reflect on your progress.\n\nCAPTURE A MOMENT\nSave text, selected photos, or both. A title, tag or category can wait. Use the system share menu to bring in text, images and website sources.\n\nREVISIT YOUR TIMELINE\nBrowse life in time order, search earlier records, and organize with lightweight tags and links. Pin an entry, add a follow-up thought, or write a weekly reflection.\n\nMAKE ROOM FOR ACTION\nKeep habits, check-ins, goals and lightweight tasks together. Tasks include lists, fixed calendar repeats and optional reminders. Important dates support Gregorian and Chinese lunar calendars and home-screen widgets.\n\nNOTICE EVERYDAY CHANGES\nManually record weight, sleep and time investment. Save dated CNY asset and liability balance snapshots to review household net worth. These are personal records, not medical diagnosis, investment advice or bank-connected services.\n\nKEEP CONTROL OF YOUR DATA\nCore records are stored on your device and work offline, with no developer account required. Opt into iCloud sync when you choose, and export a full backup containing your records and original images.\n\niCloud sync requires an available iCloud account, network and storage; delays or protective pauses can occur. Keep independent backups. Full backups can import only into an empty database and do not merge existing records. Exported ZIP and CSV files are not encrypted; store them securely.\n\nFor iPhone, in English and Simplified Chinese. Camera, notification and alarm permissions are requested for features you choose to use; alarms depend on OS support. No ads, in-app purchases or subscriptions.\n\nLeave yourself something to remember.",
